From ac1ffb29235382a1258b9d4ab9dae9dc5a8ee72d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ry <ry@Mac.eau.wi.charter.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 22:07:35 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Embed build: :app is an Android library (RECONSTRUCTED;
 original patches lost)

Base: SapphireRhodonite/WatermelonDS tag 0.8.0.rc2 (6f716d78). Recreated from the consumer side
(Nebulos core-watermelonds) and the decompiled Release 15 build:
- com.android.application -> com.android.library, group me.magnum / version embedded
  (Nebulos: includeBuild substitute module me.magnum:app -> :app)
- AGP 9.2.1 (already), Kotlin 2.4.0 on the buildscript classpath, KSP 2.3.12, Hilt 2.60.1, Room 2.8.5
- JDK 17 (was 21) for all modules, foojay toolchain resolver removed
- arm64-v8a only (native + librashader), only gitHub/prod variants enabled (consumer pins gitHubProd{Debug,Release})
- signing/applicationId/version/minify removed (host app does R8), buildConfig on, CMake 3.31.6
- Hilt Gradle plugin kept in the library so @AndroidEntryPoint classes extend Hilt_*
- librashader NDK lookup prefers the pinned AppConfig.ndkVersion (28.0.13004108)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
